
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# <Verb> <what it does>
# 50 chars max 
#
# Why this change, not how it works.
# 72 chars max 
# 
#
# The subject must complete: "If applied, this commit will ___"
#
#   Add       new capability or file
#   Fix       broken behaviour
#   Refactor  structure changes, behaviour does not
#   Remove    deleted code
#   Rename    renaming only
#   Update    adjustment to something existing
#   Document  comments, README
#
#   One commit = one reason to change.
#   "and" in the subject means it should have been two commits.
#   Body only when the "why" is not obvious.
